window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>These forgotten witches aren't too wicked to fall for.</b></p> <p>A coven of shadows with a curse on my heart and my house. They bake f*cked-up cupcakes in my kitchen and unalive influencers in my front yard. These men make zombies out of their own relatives, and a panting mess out of their own wife.</p> <p>The Witchwoods are a violent stain on the world. Eradicating that blight is worth the dirty, rotten things we do. With a second coven's sacrifice, we can close the gate. Locking the Hag Wytch in her supernatural prison has to be easier with more witches.</p> <p>Bet nobody wants to help me in exchange for cumcakes, huh?</p> <p>The Witchwood Boys Did Me Dirty <i>is a reverse harem/why choose romance (meaning one woman with three men). It's a dark, sensual romantasy with a splash of campy horror. Inside, you'll find graveyards, romps in dark woods, and confessions of undying love. Narrated in duet style.</i></p> <p><i>Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
